The vectors in this directory are copied, unchanged, from the `age/testdata`
folder of the Community Cryptography Test Vectors (C2SP CCTV),
https://github.com/C2SP/CCTV, at commit
4448f2097b2daa812c91a26141f9f36c2096b9ca.

Upstream states their license as follows (age/README.md, "License"; the whole
upstream README is kept beside this file as UPSTREAM-README.md):

